foods at certain times of day.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:31.860
But if I eat them at
other times a day,

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:33.510
I get a blood sugar crash.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.190
It also taught me,
for instance, how

00:06:35.190 --> 00:06:38.070
to space my exercise
and my food intake.

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:41.370
It turns out for me, exercising
fasted is far more beneficial.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.140
That's something I
learned using Levels.

00:06:43.140 --> 00:06:44.970
And it's completely
transformed, not

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:48.240
just the spacing and timing
of my diet and exercise,

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:51.600
but also use of things like
the sauna and other activities.

00:06:51.600 --> 00:06:53.580
It's been a tremendous
learning for me

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:56.190
that's really shaped an enormous
number of factors in my life

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:59.370
that have led to me feeling
far more vigorous with far more

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:02.262
