time, Andrew."

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.270
And I only sort of
followed the advice.

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:20.550
LEX FRIDMAN: Yeah,
well, you surprised me,

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:25.080
surprised the world, that
you're able to talk for hours

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.870
and cite some of the
best science going on

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.610
