00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.350
Stanford is proud of you.

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.728
So yeah, it's a beautiful thing.

00:09:45.728 --> 00:09:46.770
It was really surprising.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.200
