actually useful for people.

00:10:02.430 --> 00:10:03.958
So that was impressive.

00:10:03.958 --> 00:10:06.000
It's like holy shit, he
actually pulled this off.

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:12.010
And doing it every week
on a different topic--

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:15.190
I mean, I'm usually
positive, especially

00:10:15.190 --> 00:10:16.810
