talked about this in warfare

00:36:01.870 --> 00:36:06.010
in that all the elements of
the human spirit and condition

00:36:06.010 --> 00:36:09.513
still emerge at various times.

00:36:09.513 --> 00:36:10.930
I find this amazing,
and you and I

00:36:10.930 --> 00:36:12.638
have had conversations
about this before,

00:36:12.638 --> 00:36:16.288
but the aperture of the mind.

00:36:16.288 --> 00:36:18.130
The classic story
that comes to mind

00:36:18.130 --> 00:36:21.250
is the one of Viktor
Frankl or Nelson Mandela.

00:36:21.250 --> 00:36:23.980
You put somebody into a
small box of confinement

00:36:23.980 --> 00:36:27.940
and some people break
under those conditions

00:36:27.940 --> 00:36:31.360
