but it kills sperm.

00:44:44.440 --> 00:44:46.240
So for people that--

00:44:46.240 --> 00:44:47.930
sperm are on a 60
day sperm cycle

00:44:47.930 --> 00:44:49.835
so if you're trying
to donate sperm--

00:44:49.835 --> 00:44:51.460
because that's what
got us on to this--

00:44:51.460 --> 00:44:55.690
or fertilize an egg or
eggs in whatever format,

00:44:55.690 --> 00:44:58.660
dish or in vivo, as we say
in science, which means--

00:44:58.660 --> 00:45:02.890
well, you can look it up, folks.

00:45:02.890 --> 00:45:04.100
The 60 day sperm cycle.

00:45:04.100 --> 00:45:06.670
So if you go into
a really hot sauna

00:45:06.670 --> 00:45:09.940
or a hot bath or a
hot tub, in 60 days

00:45:09.940 --> 00:45:11.165
those sperm are going to be--

00:45:11.165 --> 00:45:12.790
