be non-viable.

00:45:14.830 --> 00:45:16.210
So there's a simple solution.

00:45:16.210 --> 00:45:21.610
People just put ice pack down
there or a jar, not this jar,

00:45:21.610 --> 00:45:25.302
but a jar of cold fluid between
their legs and just sit there,

00:45:25.302 --> 00:45:27.010
or they go back and
forth between the ice

00:45:27.010 --> 00:45:27.940
bath and the sauna.

00:45:27.940 --> 00:45:30.890
But you probably-- if you're
going to go back over there

00:45:30.890 --> 00:45:32.722
